  "description": "Discontinued, superseded by SolarisMAX Gen4. This page is kept as an archive record for owners and for anyone researching an older Cotic Solaris.\n\nYears of production: 2017\n\nThe first SolarisMAX: our flagship big wheel hardtail, 29er or 27.5+. Our fastest hardtail got faster. The SolarisMAX is confidence inspiring, agile and fun, with a planted feel at high speed on the rocks and carve-it-up traction in the corners.\n\nNew for 2017: our hardtail handling was translated to a Boost width platform with 148mm rear spacing, for stiffer, more responsive wheels, thru axle security, and massive tyre clearance for up to 27.5 x 3.0\" tyres. Add stunning new colour options and internal 'Stealth' dropper seatpost routing and you had all the hardtail you would ever need.\n\nFinishes: Gloss Black and Aqua, Gloss Black and Orange, and Metallic Champagne.\nSizes: Medium (17.5\"), Large (19\") and XL (20.5\").",
